{"c":{"255701":["Scarlet El Vandimion","Female","b255701-vTMYByCyesD4.png","Eldest daughter of the Duke of Vandimion, from a young age Scarlett was known for her overly violent behavior - to the point where others called her the Mad Dog Princess. While she now normally bottles up her emotions to please her family, sometimes she still needs to let loose..",820],"336652":["Nanaka","Male","b336652-43YKDU8JdMUg.jpg","A young spy and slave for Godwin, who was sent to pose as a maid for House Vandimion. Nanaka is a male beastkin who is often confused as a girl due to his androgynous figure and gender-neutral name. After Scarlet removes his enslavement curse, he sides with her in return.",65],"359260":["Julius Von Pallistan","Male","b359260-8BG0AcmXRLuH.jpg","The first prince of the Kingdom of Pallistan. Unlike his brother, Julius stands calm, charming, and interested in strange things. He does not wish to be a mere figurehead for the masses and desires to understand his people of the kingdom he will eventually lead.",124],"359261":["Sigurd Forgrave","Male","b359261-OyCWSi4wB8HC.png","",12],"359263":["Leonardo El Vandimion","Male","b359263-TvzkU04iQZzI.png","Scarlett's older brother as well as Julius' attendant and best friend.",49],"359264":["Kyle Von Pallistan","Male","b359264-pyTTWTLVrnli.png","",0],"359265":["Terenezza Hopkins","Female","b359265-BuYA7hMfGzBi.jpg","",14],"375050":["Rosalia Madeleine","Female","b375050-lpPQ1b7exNqA.jpg","Rosalia is Scarlet's friend from the Royal Noble Academy.",3],"378574":["Envi Champagne","Female","b378574-03z0BIJlK5WO.png","Envi is Scarlet's friend and rival from the Royal Noble Academy. She is a count's daughter and often teased by Rosalia.",3],"378576":["Heine","Male","b378576-dMMt9IPIfJK8.png","Godwin's son.",0],"378577":["Lassen",null,"default.jpg","",0],"378578":["Kizoku",null,"default.jpg","",0],"378579":["Female Student","Female","default.jpg","",0],"378580":["Kizoku",null,"default.jpg","",0],"378581":["Vandimion Koushaku","Ma